==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{af|is|setja<t:to put>|-st}}.

===Verb===
{{head|is|verb}}

# to [[sit down|sit (down)]]
#: {{ant|is|standa upp}}
#: {{ux|is|Ég '''sest''' [[niður]].|I '''sit down'''.}}
# (of the sun or moon) to [[go down]]
#: {{syn|is|ganga undir}}
#: {{ux|is|[[sól|Sólin]] '''sest'''.|The [[sun]] is '''going down'''.}}

====Usage notes====
* Often used (in the meaning of "sitting down") with ''[[niður#Icelandic|niður]]'' ("[[down]]").

